-- The museum gardens (the book's Area 1 map, 1A-1E), redrawn in our pieces. Turned half round
-- from the book's page so the museum's doors stand along the north edge and the party comes up
-- the two paths from the DM's side. The book's map is 20 squares across, like the mat: one square
-- of path off the near edge is all that's dropped.

